IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-HYPER-REGISTER.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-Q4-BLOCKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ZMM-BANKS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 VIA-LINES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-HYPER-REG.
    IF NUM-Q4-BLOCKS == 0 OR ZMM-BANKS == 0 OR VIA-LINES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 112400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-Q4-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
